+    title: 'A MESSAGE\'S STATES · one hue each, none another state wears (PM, 6 Nov), measured on their wash',
+    intro: '',
+    entries: [
+      { name: '--ink-scheduled', light: '#5b34c7', dark: '#c4b2ff', why: '6.58', whyDark: '8.42 on the wash below' },
