s Bernardo|DB,ES:ok:Approved v3|María Franco Fernández|MF,DE:ok:Approved v3|Nicolai Klutke|NK,IT:ok:Approved v3|María Franco Fernández|MF\",\"handed\":true},{\"label\":\"PUBLISHED\",\"means\":\"Sent. Nothing comes back to this screen.\",\"colour\":{\"title\":\"Finished and gone\",\"means\":\"A message handed to Batch, and a campaign whose every message has gone.\"},\"ink\":\"#25282e\",\"wash\":\"#d9dce1\",\"chart\":{\"stroke\":\"#25282e\",\"ink\":\"#fff\",\"fill\":\"#25282e\"}}]","confirm":"[{\"title\":\"Discard changes?\",\"body\":\"All blocks go back to v3. Approvals stay.\",\"cta\":\"Discard changes\",\"tone\":\"danger\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/reply.svg\",\"reason\":false},{\"title\":\"Discard changes?\",\"body\":\"All blocks go back to the document as created. Approvals stay.\",\"cta\":\"Discard changes\",\"tone\":\"danger\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/reply.svg\",\"reason\":false},{\"title\":\"Create version 4?\",\"body\":\"Jean and Adrien will need to approve version 4 again. This cannot be undone.\",\"cta\":\"Create version 4\",\"tone\":\"proposed\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/copy.svg\",\"reason\":false},{\"title\":\"Create version 4?\",\"body\":\"Nobody has approved v3, so no approval is lost. This cannot be undone.\",\"cta\":\"Create version 4\",\"tone\":\"proposed\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/copy.svg\",\"reason\":false},{\"title\":\"Withdraw your approval on v3?\",\"body\":\"You will need to approve again. Thomas sees your reason.\",\"cta\":\"Withdraw\",\"tone\":\"danger\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/reply.svg\",\"reason\":true},{\"title\":\"Withdraw Adrien’s approval on v3?\",\"body\":\"It waits for you to approve. Adrien and Thomas see your reason.\",\"cta\":\"Withdraw\",\"tone\":\"danger\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/reply.svg\",\"reason\":true},{\"title\":\"Withdraw your approval on behalf of Adrien?\",\"body\":\"It waits for Adrien again. Your reason is shown with it.\",\"cta\":\"Withdraw\",\"tone\":\"danger\",\"icon\":\"lucide-icons/reply.svg\",\"reason\":true}]","notice":"{}","dialogModes":"[{\"mode\":\"ask\",\"label\":\"actAssign\"},{\"mode\":\"remind\",\"label\":\"actRemind\"},{\"mode\":\"behalf\",\"label\":\"behalf\"},{\"mode\":\"version\",\"label\":\"draftNew\"}]","rights":"[[{\"key\":\"cm\",\"name\":\"Content manager\"},{\"key\":\"PRD\",\"name\":\"Product\"},{\"key\":\"LGL\",\"name\":\"Legal\"},{\"key\":\"reviewer\",\"name\":\"Locale reviewer\"}],[[\"Write and edit the draft\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"draft\",\"Only the content manager who holds the seat writes the source, inside the bulk edit (F3). Once a version is cut the text is read-only for him too — Edit content is the way back in. Everyone else proposes.\"],[\"Create a version\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"draft\",\"Create version {n} cuts it from the bulk edit, first time and every time after, with a confirm that names who loses a signature (VC2). Voids every approval given on the version before; nobody is asked again (S5).\"],[\"Discard changes\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"discard\",\"Only the content manager who holds the bulk edit, and only once its text has changed. Every block goes back to the last version; before v1, to the document as created. Asks first. Voids nothing, and the text it drops is in no version and no event (CloseBulkEdit, F2 · DC1 · PM, 6 Oct).\"],[\"Notify and assign\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"manage\",\"One window over every gate, optional: assigns whoever nobody holds, reminds whoever holds a gate, assigns someone else on a gate held and unsigned. A signed gate never moves (NW1, NW2, AS4). Only the content manager who holds the seat (SR1 · PM, 6 Oct).\"],[\"Approve on behalf\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"behalf\",\"Marked on behalf, the person is told, and they can withdraw it. A gate nobody holds is signed for the role, no Ask first, no reason asked (OB2, OB5). Only the content manager who holds the seat signs on behalf (SR1).\"],[\"Remind\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"manage\",\"Mentions the holder again, from inside the same window. Nothing on the message changes, and a gate only offers it once somebody has been asked. Only the content manager who holds the seat (SR1).\"],[\"Send\",\"yes no no no\",\"\",\"send\",\"One person sends, and only with the counter at zero (SN2).\"],[\"Approve a gate\",\"yes yes yes own\",\"every role\",\"approve\",\"A locale reviewer approves their own language, not the message. The content manager reaches this through Approve on behalf rather than a button of his own.\"],[\"Withdraw an approval\",\"own own own own\",\"every role\",\"withdraw\",\"Taken back by the one who gave it, or by the approval’s holder, any time until Sent: on behalf only stands in for someone away, so the gate stays theirs (WA1), and a signed gate taken over brings its signature to the new holder (TK1 · PM, 5 Oct). The content manager takes back one he gave on behalf in the on-behalf window, with the seat (TB1).\"],[\"Assign myself\",\"no no own own\",\"approvers\",\"takeover\",\"Only gates in your own pool, held or not, no Ask first (NA9). Taking one removes the person who held it, who is told; a signed gate comes with its signature, which the new holder may take back (NA8, TK1).\"],[\"Confirm a block\",\"yes no no own\",\"not the bar · the block\",\"\",\"The owner confirms their own blocks. The content manager can too, and it is recorded on the owner’s behalf.\"],[\"Edit a translation\",\"yes no no own\",\"not the bar · the block\",\"\",\"The content manager produces every language; a reviewer only edits theirs.\"],[\"Propose a change on the source\",\"no yes yes yes\",\"not the bar · the block\",\"\",\"The content manager edits directly instead, so proposing would be talking to nobody.\"],[\"Accept or reject a proposal\",\"yes no no no\",\"not the bar · the proposal card\",\"\",\"One decider. Accepting creates the next version.\"],[\"Add a comment\",\"yes yes yes yes\",\"not the bar · always live\",\"\",\"On any block, in any state, at any time. A comment changes nothing on its own.\"],[\"Rename\",\"yes no no no\",\"not the bar · the row menu\",\"\",\"Hidden for the others rather than disabled. Blocked once the message is sent — sent is sent, label included.\"],[\"Delete\",\"yes no no no\",\"not the bar · the row menu\",\"\",\"Only before anything has been sent. Goes to the trash for 30 days, not straight out.\"],[\"Restore from trash\",\"yes no no no\",\"not the bar · the row menu\",\"\",\"From the campaign list, while the countdown is still running.\"]]]","blockStates":"[{\"code\":\"B 01\",\"title\":\"Free, unchanged\",\"means\":\"The ordinary block. It last moved in v1 and nobody is holding it.\",\"facts\":{\"version\":3,\"headVersion\":1,\"proposal\":null,\"myDraft\":false,\"bulk\":false,\"bulkMine\":false,\"sent\":false,\"role\":\"content-manager\",\"me\":\"\"},\"badge\":{\"label\":\"v1\",\"tone\":\"quiet\"},\"lock\":{\"state\":\"free\",\"by\":\"\"},\"menu\":[{\"id\":\"edit\",\"label\":\"Edit\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"comment\",\"label\":\"Comment\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"history\",\"label\":\"History\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"}]},{\"code\":\"B 02\",\"title\":\"Moved in this version\",\"means\":\"CHANGED is a comparison, not a flag — its head revision was cut into the version now current.\",\"facts\":{\"version\":3,\"headVersion\":3,\"proposal\":null,\"myDraft\":false,\"bulk\":false,\"bulkMine\":false,\"sent\":false,\"role\":\"content-manager\",\"me\":\"\"},\"badge\":{\"label\":\"CHANGED\",\"tone\":\"moved\"},\"lock\":{\"state\":\"free\",\"by\":\"\"},\"menu\":[{\"id\":\"edit\",\"label\":\"Edit\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"comment\",\"label\":\"Comment\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"history\",\"label\":\"History\",\"tone\":\"normal\",\"reason\":\"\"}]},{\"code\":\"B 03\",\"title\":\"Still a draft\",\"means\":\"No version exists yet, so there is no number to name.\",\"facts\":{\"version\":\"draft\",\"headVersion\":\"draft\",\"proposal\":null,\"myDraft\":false,\"bulk\":fals